  "jobTitle": "Web Project Manager",
  "summary": "I’m a Web Project Manager with 7 years of experience in web development, bringing a strong combination of technical expertise, project coordination, and problem-solving to every project I manage.\n\nWith a background in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, PHP, and modern web technologies, I understand both the technical and business sides of delivering successful digital projects. This allows me to communicate effectively with developers, designers, stakeholders, and clients while keeping projects aligned with scope, timelines, priorities, and business goals.\n\nThroughout my career, I’ve worked with businesses of various sizes to plan, build, optimize, and maintain websites and web applications. I’m experienced in coordinating projects from initial requirements through development, testing, launch, and ongoing improvements, with a strong focus on quality, user experience, and successful delivery.\n\nI thrive in collaborative environments where I can organize priorities, solve challenges, improve processes, and help teams move projects forward. My technical background enables me to anticipate development challenges, translate complex requirements into actionable tasks, and bridge the gap between technical teams and stakeholders.\n\nI’m passionate about delivering web projects that are not only completed successfully, but also create measurable value for businesses and their users.\n\nLet’s connect and discuss how I can help turn your next web project from an idea into a successful launch.",
